<title>UK: BA average fare yield up 1.3 pct.</title>
<headline>BA average fare yield up 1.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways Plc said on Monday that its average fare yield for every kilometre travelled on its mainline scheduled network rose 1.3 percent in the financial year to March 31.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
